# A radio checks itself and unchecks its group; tapped again, nothing; the
# arrows move the check past the disabled radio and wrap.
tap green
tap green
key green ArrowDown
key blue ArrowRight
# Red again: WebKit's arrows do not wrap past the group's last radio (plain HTML), so the steps after
# start from one state in every engine.
tap red
# A group whose action refuses snaps back; a checkbox's InputEvent.
tap locked-b
tap mint
# A field's selection: typed, set by setSelectionRange, replaced by a key.
type editor hello
tap jump
key editor x
tap collapse
